    aa83f35, MIT, same owner): the Common_, Dialog_, Edit_, Color_ and Pick_ entries, word
    for word, except Color_DialogTitle ("Section color" there, "Color" here). The Settings_,
    Status_ and Preview_ entries are Splash-It's own.
  -->
